   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2016-03-02",
   "text": "No Lead in the Air Act of 2016\n This bill directs the Federal Aviation Administration to issue regulations necessary to prohibit the use of leaded fuel by aircraft operating within U.S. airspace beginning in January 2021."
